<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>The URBS Post</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-title { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .subtitle { font-size: 12pt; }
  .section-title { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .column-content { display: flex; gap: 40px; }
  .column { flex: 1; }
  .list-item { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .signature-block { margin-top: 20px; }
  .footer { margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 10pt; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  td { padding: 8px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <div class="header-title">Newsletter of</div>
      <div class="subtitle">CSUN Department of Urban Studies and Planning</div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="URBS Post Logo" style="width: 150px;">
      <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 10px;">
        <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Fall {{ current_year }}</div>
        <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Issue</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <div class="section-title">INSIDE THIS ISSUE:</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <div class="list-item">Campus Spotlight <span data-field="campus_spotlight_pages">{{ campus_spotlight_pages }}</span></div>
          <div class="list-item">Faculty Publications <span data-field="faculty_publications_pages">{{ faculty_publications_pages }}</span></div>
          <div class="list-item">Community Partners <span data-field="community_partners_pages">{{ community_partners_pages }}</span></div>
          <div class="list-item">Alumni <span data-field="alumni_pages">{{ alumni_pages }}</span></div>
          <div class="list-item">Masters of Urban Planning <span data-field="mup_pages">{{ mup_pages }}</span></div>
          <div class="list-item">Students' News <span data-field="students_news_pages">{{ students_news_pages }}</span></div>
          <div class="list-item">Contact Us <span data-field="contact_pages">{{ contact_pages }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <div class="section-title">CHAIR'S MESSAGE</div>
        <p>The Department of Urban Studies and Planning is flourishing.</p>
        <p>The department currently boasts approximately {{ current_faculty_count }} undergraduate majors, {{ current_graduate_count }} graduate majors, and {{ current_staff_count }} staff members. We are proud to have a diverse and talented community of students, faculty, and staff.</p>
        <p>The Master's program has proved to be a strong draw for the department and has seen consistent growth in enrollment over the past few years. We are excited about the future of the program and the department.</p>
        <p>We thank all our students, faculty, and staff for their dedication and hard work. We look forward to another successful year.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <div class="section-title">FULL TIME FACULTY</div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="faculty.full_name">{{ faculty.full_name_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="faculty.title_1">{{ faculty.title_1 }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="faculty.full_name">{{ faculty.full_name_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="faculty.title_2">{{ faculty.title_2 }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="faculty.full_name">{{ faculty.full_name_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="faculty.title_3">{{ faculty.title_3 }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="faculty.full_name">{{ faculty.full_name_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="faculty.title_4">{{ faculty.title_4 }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <div class="section-title">ALUMNI ELECTED AS APA PRESIDENT: KURT CHRISTIANSEN, FAICP</div>
        <p>Our department's alumni Kurt Christiansen, FAICP was elected as President for American Planners Association (APA). He will assume office on January 1, {{ next_year }}. The APA is the economic and community development director for the City of Azusa, California. Previously, he served as community development director for Yorba Linda and development services director for Sierra Madre. He served as press secretary for the City of Azusa, California, where he chaired the Charter Presidents Council, and a member of the APA Governance Committee and the Membership Committee. He also served as the co-chair of the local host committee for the 2012 APA National Planning Conference in Los Angeles. He is a member of the California State University, Northridge, Urban Planning and Studies Department Alumni Council. Kurt was an honoree at the 2012 CSUN Vol-unteer Service Awards ceremony. He graduated from CSUN in {{ graduation_year }} with a bachelor's degree in Urban Studies and Planning and completed a Master's degree in Urban Planning from the Uni-versity of California, Los Angeles, in {{ mup_graduation_year }}.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <div class="section-title">PART-TIME FACULTY</div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="part_time_faculty.full_name">{{ part_time_faculty.full_name_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="part_time_faculty.title_1">{{ part_time_faculty.title_1 }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="part_time_faculty.full_name">{{ part_time_faculty.full_name_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="part_time_faculty.title_2">{{ part_time_faculty.title_2 }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="part_time_faculty.full_name">{{ part_time_faculty.full_name_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="part_time_faculty.title_3">{{ part_time_faculty.title_3 }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <div class="section-title">WELCOMING MIRNA</div>
        <p>Mirna Reyes joined the Department of Urban Studies and Planning in Decem-ber {{ start_year }}, as the administrative support coordinator. She graduated from Cali-fornia State University Northridge (CSUN) with a major in sociology in {{ graduation_year }}. Her professional background includes over {{ years_of_experience }} years of work in the non-profit sector, providing administrative and community development services. In her free-time, she enjoys meditation, traveling and learning about different cultures. She also mentors youth on higher education opportunities, resources and quality access.</p>
        <div class="signature-block">
          <p>Mirna Reyes</p>
          <p>Administrative Support Coordinator</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <div class="section-title">STAFF</div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="staff.full_name">{{ staff.full_name_1 }}</span> (Administrative Support Coordinator)
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="staff.full_name">{{ staff.full_name_2 }}</span> (Administrative Support Assistant)
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="staff.full_name">{{ staff.full_name_3 }}</span> (Student Assistant)
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="staff.full_name">{{ staff.full_name_4 }}</span> (Lab Assistants)
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <div class="section-title">URBAN STUDIES AND PLANNING</div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
          <img src="placeholder_csun_logo.png" alt="CSUN Logo" style="width: 200px;">
          <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 10px;">CSUN</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
