      <div class="section-title">MASTERS OF URBAN PLANNING (MUP), FIRST GRADUATES: NEW COHORT</div>
      <p>The Department of Urban Studies and Planning graduated its first co-hort of the Masters of Urban Plan-ning (MUP) program in May, {{ graduation_year }}. Congratulations graduates!</p>
      <p>The department also accepted its third cohort of students and classes began in Fall {{ start_year }}. Now we have a total of {{ total_students }} students in the graduate program.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_mup_grad.jpg" alt="MUP Graduates" style="width: 100%;">
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">THANK YOU!</div>
        <p>THANK YOU to our alumni who volun-teered to help on MOCK INTERVIEWS on April 19, 2017.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <div class="section-title">STUDENT NEWS</div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <span data-field="student.full_name">{{ student.full_name_1 }}</span> was the recipient of the {{ award_name_1 }} scholarship. He received a scholarship of ${{ award_amount_1 }} in recognition of his academic achievements.
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
